  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> »pomBasic« </h3> <h1> Universal Optics for Inspection and Measuring </h1>",
   "body": "<p>Whenever universal and targeted inspection of cutting tools is required, ZOLLER »pomBasic« gives you precise results quickly and easily: Angles, radii, distances, cutting edge quality, grinding pattern. The additional use of a diffuser (LED flat light) flexibly extends the range of applications for transmitted light measurements. For example, external contours can also be quickly measured and documented.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#c3759\">Measurements</a> <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#c3760\">»pomLightTube«</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/e/3/csm_pombasic_Anwendungen_Optik_37c41c5354.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1454,
     "h": 1454
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c2193",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {
    "before": "small",
    "after": "small"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "overlay",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/9/csm_Pombasic_Anwendungen_en_9fe4c80465.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 996,
    "h": 836
   },
   "title": "Measurements",
   "text": "<p>»pomBasic« measures all relevant parameters of all types of cutting tools such as drills, milling cutters, saw blades, forming tools and cutting inserts in incident light.</p>",
   "ftype": "zoller_overlay",
   "id": "c3759",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "overlay",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/7/1/csm_Pombasic_Anwendungen_pomlighttube_2a_320e23ee45.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 996,
    "h": 644
   },
   "title": "»pomLightTube«",
   "text": "<p>Optimum illumination of complex geometries on precision tools is a prerequisite for perfect inspection and measurement. With the ZOLLER »pomLightTube« illumination, which is unique in its design, you can achieve phenomenally homogeneous image quality, even with geometries that are usually difficult to illuminate and reflective surfaces.</p>",
   "ftype": "zoller_overlay",
   "id": "c3760",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> »pomBasic MTI« </h3> <h2> Highest Perfection with “Micro” Optics </h2>",
   "body": "<p>The ZOLLER »pomBasic MTI« stands for Micro Tool Inspection and offers a compact, production-integrated solution for inspecting and measuring micro-tools. A special high-resolution microcamera with coaxial lighting enables the precise inspection of tools of the smallest size: The zoom lens captures microtools in extreme detail with a magnification range of 125x to 1250x.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#c3761\">Measurements</a> <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#c3762\">»pomLightTube«</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/5/f/csm_pombasicmicro_anwendungen_optik_b18922f2d7.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1454,
     "h": 1454
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c2194",
   "bg": "black",
   "space": {
    "before": "small",
    "after": "small"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "overlay",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/4/csm_Pombasicmicro_Anwendungen_messungen_en_5987082629.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 996,
    "h": 856
   },
   "title": "Measurements",
   "text": "<p>The »pomBasic MTI« can be used universally in the measuring room, in the goods receipt area or directly on the shop floor.</p>",
   "ftype": "zoller_overlay",
   "id": "c3761",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "overlay",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/6/f/csm_Pombasicmicro_Anwendungen_pomlighttube_en_7ed069f0ca.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 996,
    "h": 872
   },
   "title": "Micro Tool Inspection for Small Tools",
   "text": "<p>With the ZOLLER »pomBasic MTI«, you can inspect even the smallest detail with the utmost precision. We call this ZOLLER high-performance for consistent quality of your micro tools.</p>",
   "ftype": "zoller_overlay",
   "id": "c3762",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Tool Inspection – Well Thought Through </h2>",
   "body": "<p>Assistant-guided measurement sequences, complete inspection reports at the touch of a button, and tool-specific management of all parameters in the central ZOLLER tool database z.One ensure efficient production processes and traceable quality at all times.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/in/company/contact-us\">Request now</a> <a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://myzoller.com/us/en/expert/booking/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">1:1 expert meeting</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/5/f/csm_pombasic__preview_d99311c8eb.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1080,
     "h": 858
    }
